# Configuration File Policy for indi-allsky Debian Package
#
# This package does NOT ship static conffiles under /etc/.
# All configuration files are generated dynamically during postinst:
#
#   /etc/indi-allsky/flask.json     - Generated from flask.json_template via jq
#   /etc/indi-allsky/indiserver.env - Generated from debconf responses
#
# On upgrade, flask.json is merged (new template keys added, user values preserved).
# On purge, all files under /etc/indi-allsky/ are removed by postrm.
#
# This approach is intentional: the configuration contains secrets (SECRET_KEY,
# PASSWORD_KEY, OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET) that must be generated at install time,
# and user-specific values (camera driver, location) that come from debconf.
